{
  "name": "Chase missing client documents from Google Sheets with Gmail reminders",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "22f8a2d7-d1db-48d8-8785-45d94a9f3af6",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -980,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Chase missing client documents\n\n### How it works\nEvery weekday morning this workflow reads the open requests in your Google Sheet. For each one it checks how long ago the last message went out and chooses the first request, a reminder or a final reminder. OpenAI writes the email in your firm's tone, Gmail sends it, and the sheet records the date and the reminder count. Rows marked Received are skipped.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named Requests and the columns Client, Email, Document, Due date, Status, Last sent, Reminders. Set Status to Open on each request.\n2. Add your Google Sheets, Gmail and OpenAI credentials to the nodes.\n3. Fill in the Settings node: sheet ID, firm name, reply address, days between reminders.\n4. Run once by hand to test, then activate.\n\n### Customization tips\nChange the reminder spacing or the tone instructions, or swap Gmail for Outlook."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "85b81add-1cab-48d5-bd1b-7eb2372d32e2",
      "name": "Section: read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -420,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Read open requests\nRuns each weekday morning and loads every row still marked Open."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "856407eb-31a3-4120-bfa7-03f8f7fc6639",
      "name": "Section: decide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        300,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Decide which message to send\nCounts the days since the last message and picks the step."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ef5691e8-c971-467e-ade0-c9361b979d0d",
      "name": "Section: send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        800,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Write and send the email\nOpenAI drafts it in your tone, Gmail sends it."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fedb32ec-e02d-4564-a849-45a502b471a8",
      "name": "Section: update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1300,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Update the sheet\nRecords the date and the reminder count."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2c47cc67-513b-45e9-98c1-b20e934d480b",
      "name": "Every weekday at 8 am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        -360,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "f6db1f7a-512e-42b0-a3a5-c173d1ae6c79",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        -140,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "2ff318f8-94c6-49e4-bddc-0cb0b9048475",
              "name": "sheetId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "099f9bcd-f832-4232-b4d6-0039d5317f07",
              "name": "firmName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your Firm Name"
            },
            {
              "id": "5838f36b-7869-4210-9377-351c358385a6",
              "name": "replyTo",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "user@example.com"
            },
            {
              "id": "5f99f3ec-c364-4e80-8ee6-f6b40096f423",
              "name": "daysBetweenReminders",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "078b3341-2c9e-4894-9dca-1f2d76fe9556",
              "name": "maxReminders",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "c40f1125-b5b4-4fc4-8b3a-9cdf2600e0ae",
              "name": "tone",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Warm, brief and professional. Plain words. No pressure."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "746c1c68-697b-45ee-8fa3-f0f51976c1e0",
      "name": "Get open requests",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        80,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupValue": "Open",
              "lookupColumn": "Status"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Requests"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.sheetId }}"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "f49aea43-f097-46cd-a0f9-7ec3ab0cd625",
      "name": "Work out the next step",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        360,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1faafc9d-69b1-47fa-a47f-86ef2580a8d9",
              "name": "remindersSent",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.Reminders || 0) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d5f60f1a-f598-47cc-81c5-65ecf491942e",
              "name": "daysSinceLast",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json['Last sent'] ? Math.floor(($now.toMillis() - DateTime.fromISO(String($json['Last sent'])).toMillis()) / 86400000) : 999 }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "60d75f96-a0e3-426a-b511-00c383544e48",
              "name": "step",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.Reminders || 0) === 0 ? 'first request' : (Number($json.Reminders || 0) >= $('Settings').first().json.maxReminders - 1 ? 'final reminder' : 'reminder') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "3bbb477d-f741-46d3-970f-e6f3b24f3a30",
      "name": "Is a message due?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        580,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "359492a4-f121-4be0-92c0-18c4aaa3f218",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.daysSinceLast }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.daysBetweenReminders }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "02577319-ba6c-495e-abf7-ebeae9ba8bd2",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lt"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.remindersSent }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.maxReminders }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "16705f2f-5738-4c3f-9dd6-f1668a71e8fa",
      "name": "Write the email",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "position": [
        860,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O-MINI"
        },
        "options": {},
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You write short emails for {{ $('Settings').first().json.firmName }}, an accounting firm. Tone: {{ $('Settings').first().json.tone }} Reply with JSON only, using the keys subject and body. The body is plain text, under 90 words, signed with the firm name. Never invent deadlines, amounts or facts that are not given."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Write the {{ $json.step }} asking this client for a document.\nClient: {{ $json.Client }}\nDocument needed: {{ $json.Document }}\nDue date: {{ $json['Due date'] || 'not set' }}\nReminders already sent: {{ $json.remindersSent }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.8
    },
    {
      "id": "7a1b4894-3182-4a2a-8ede-5c5b9343ddb3",
      "name": "Send the email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
        1100,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Is a message due?').item.json.Email }}",
        "message": "={{ $json.message.content.body }}",
        "options": {
          "replyTo": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.replyTo }}",
          "appendAttribution": false
        },
        "subject": "={{ $json.message.content.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    },
    {
      "id": "0dafa43a-8260-4030-8cae-240fc0b705ac",
      "name": "Record the reminder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        1380,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "Last sent": "={{ $now.toISODate() }}",
            "Reminders": "={{ $('Is a message due?').item.json.remindersSent + 1 }}",
            "row_number": "={{ $('Is a message due?').item.json.row_number }}"
          },
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "row_number",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "removed": false,
              "readOnly": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "row_number",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Last sent",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Last sent",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Reminders",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Reminders",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ],
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "update",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Requests"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.sheetId }}"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.5
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
